Output demo.gif
Output demo.webm
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1100
Set Height 620
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Shell "bash"

Hide
Type `cd "$NFB_DEMO" && export PS1="$ " && clear`
Enter
Show

Type "nix-fast-build --flake .#checks"
Enter
Sleep 14s
Type "f"
Sleep 2s
Type "j"
Sleep 1s
Type "k"
Sleep 2s
Type "d"
Sleep 1s
Type "1"
Sleep 3s
Type "q"
Sleep 12s
Type "q"
Sleep 3s
